L342: Electronic Instructions for Use (eIFUs)\nL343: \nL344: * * *\nL345: \nL346:   * 【115†BD products†eifu.bd.com】\nL347: \nL348: true\nL349: \nL350: Resources\nL351: \nL352: 【116†Image: Literature】\nL353: \nL354: Literature\nL355: \nL356: Our collection of literature on industries and on our offerings gives you information you can use to continue striving for excellence.\nL357: \nL358: 【117†Learn more】\nL359: \nL360: 【118†Image: events-icon-boosted-blue.svg】\nL361: \nL362: Events\nL363: We support the healthcare industry with market-leading products and services that aim to improve care while lowering costs. We host and take part in events that excel in advancing the world of health™.\nL364: \nL365: 【119†Learn more】\nL366: \nL367: 【120†Image: training icon】\nL368: \nL369: Training\nL370: \nL371: The BD Learning Academy offers a centralized repository of BD product training, education, and the ability to connect courses to your LMS.\nL372: \nL373: 【121†Learn More†academy.bd.com】\nL374: \nL375: 【122†Image: case-studies-icon】\nL376: \nL377: Case Studies\nL378: We promote clinical excellence by providing various resources on best practices, clinical innovations and industry trends in healthcare.\nL379: \nL380: 【123†Learn more】\nL381: \nL382: true\nL383: \nL384: References\nL385: \nL386: false\nL387: \nL388: Frequently Asked Questions\nL389: \nL390: false\nL391: \nL392: References\nL393: \nL394: false\nL395: \nL396: Alternatives Comparison\nL397: \nL398: [Input] [Input] [Button: Download as xlsx file ]\nL399: \nL400:   * Alternatives Comparison\nL401: \nL402: [Input] [Input] [Button: Download as xlsx file ]\nL403:   *     * Product Name\nL404:     * SKU Number\nL405:     * Shelf Life (Days)\nL406:     * Product Name\nL407:     * SKU Number\nL408:     * Shelf Life (Days)\nL409:     * Product Name\nL410:     * SKU Number\nL411:     * Shelf Life (Days)\nL412:     * Product Name\nL413:     * SKU Number\nL414:     * Shelf Life (Days)\nL415: \nL416:   * 【124†Image: Product I