ew\nL282:   2. Specifications\nL283:   3. eIFUs and Resources\nL284:   4. FAQ\nL285:   5. Related Products\nL286:   6. Product Notifications\nL287: \nL288: Overview\nL289: BD supplies more than 400 different BD Difco™ and BD BBL™ brand media formulations and ingredients in dehydrated form for the convenience of the laboratorian and bioprocessing specialist.\nL290: \nL291: true\nL292: \nL293: Features and Benefits\nL294: \nL295: FEATURE AND BENEFIT CARDS NOT AVAILABLE\nL296: \nL297: FEATURE AND BENEFIT CARDS NOT AVAILABLE\nL298: \nL299: Promotional Story\nL300: \nL301: false\nL302: \nL303: References\nL304: \nL305: false\nL306: \nL307: Specification\nL308: \nL309: * * *\nL310: \nL311: GTIN\nL312: \nL313: 【112†Image: minus-icon】 【113†Image: plus-icon】\nL314: \nL315: GTIN - Each\nL316: \nL317: 00382902340003\nL318: \nL319: 1\nL320: \nL321: * * *\nL322: \nL323: Packaging\nL324: 【112†Image: minus-icon】 【113†Image: plus-icon】\nL325: \nL326: Quantity\nL327: \nL328: 500 g/EA\nL329: ### GTIN\nL330: \nL331: GTIN - Each  | 00382902340003  | 1\nL332: ### Packaging\nL333: \nL334: Quantity  | 500 g/EA\nL335: \nL336: References\nL337: \nL338: false\nL339: \nL340: Electronic Instructions for Use (eIFUs)\nL341: \nL342: * * *\nL343: \nL344:   * 【114†BD products†eifu.bd.com】\nL345: \nL346: true\nL347: \nL348: Resources\nL349: \nL350: 【115†Image: Literature】\nL351: \nL352: Literature\nL353: \nL354: Our collection of literature on industries and on our offerings gives you information you can use to continue striving for excellence.\nL355: \nL356: 【116†Learn more】\nL357: \nL358: 【117†Image: events-icon-boosted-blue.svg】\nL359: \nL360: Events\nL361: We support the healthcare industry with market-leading products and services that aim to improve care while lowering costs. We host and take part in events that excel in advancing the world of health™.\nL362: \nL363: 【118†Learn more】\nL364: \nL365: 【119†Image: training icon】\nL366: \nL367: Training\nL368: \nL369: The BD Learning Academy offers a centralized repository of BD product training, education, and the ability to connect courses to your LMS.\nL370: \nL371: 【120†Learn More†academy.bd.com】\nL372: \nL373: 【121†Image: case-studies-icon】\nL374: \nL375: Case Studies\nL376: We promote clinical excellence by providing various resources on best practices, clinical innovations and industry trends in healthcare.\nL377: \nL378: 【122†Learn more】\nL379: \nL380: true\nL381: \nL382: References\nL383: \nL384: false\nL385: \nL386: Frequently Asked Questions\nL387: \nL388: false\nL389: \nL390: References\nL391: \nL392: false\nL393: \nL394: Related Products\nL395: \nL396: RELATED PRODUCTS NOT AVAILABLE\nL397: \nL398: References\nL399: \nL400: false\nL401: \nL402: Product Complaints\nL403: \nL404: North American Regional Complaint Center\nL405: \nL406: 1-844-8BD-LIFE (1-844-823-5433)\nL407: \nL408: productcomplaints@bd.com productcomplaints@bd.com ( productcomplaints@bd.com)\nL409: \nL410: Things to Consider\nL411: \nL412: * * *\nL413: If you are a patient or end user, you can contact us yourself, or you may have your caregiver or your physician do that for you. To help us process your\nL414: information quickly and effectively, please contact our customer complaints\nL415: team.\nL416: To better facilitate our investigation, please include the following information in your reporting:\nL417:   * Product Name and/or Catalog Number\nL418:   * Lot Number or Serial Number\nL419:   * Any injuries and/or harm?\nL420:   * What is the issue you experienced?\nL421:   * Is the actual sample or sample representative available? (If possible, please send affected sample)\nL422:   * Contact name and phone number\nL423: \nL424: Product Recalls\nL425: \nL426: 【123†Image: Literature Icon】\nL427: \nL428: Recall Notifications\nL429: \nL430: These recall notices provide current information on medical device recalls.\nL431: \nL432: 【124†Learn more†bdx.my.site.com】\nL433: \nL434: References\nL435: \nL436: false\nL437:   * Follow us\nL438: